{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1476373-\u200b-\u00e6on-rule-questions-about-recreating-psychic-gifts-with-regular-telepathy","id":1476373,"title":"\u200b[\u00c6on] Rule questions about recreating Psychic gifts with regular Telepathy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-14T04:45:03-07:00","id":1476373,"title":"\u200b[\u00c6on] Rule questions about recreating Psychic gifts with regular Telepathy","content":"<br /> <br /> I ran a search on the forum but couldn't find anything about it. I'll hide behind spoiler tags the parts relevant to TC:Adventure! since it isn't out yet.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">So from what I understand, Mesmerists are psiads whose development was stunted by the Doyen barrier. They are the weakest psi users in the TC setting. <br /> <br /> If some of their gifts can do things telepaths seemingly can't , but it's easy enough to imagine a lateral version of Mindshare 1 allowing to recreate &quot;All Creatures Great and Small&quot;. It shouldn't be harder to communicate telepathically with your dog than it is to communicate with sentient slugs from outer space. <br /> <br /> I was still quite surprised to discover when getting my Adventure! backerkit that their telepathic powers are, at times, shockingly impressive. I mean, gifts like &quot;Hive Mind&quot; and &quot;Mental Crucible&quot; look very much like Mindshare 5 which only a Psiad with telepathy primary, favored mode AND Psi 6 could hope to get.<br /> <br /> Most specifically, I wanted to ask if anyone had ever tried to adapt the arsenal of Jedi mind tricks and illusions that they have within the frame of the regular \u00c6on Telepathy aptitude. Gifts like &quot;Recursion&quot;, &quot;Refuge in Banality&quot;, &quot;Cloud the Mind&quot;, &quot;Papers Please&quot; or the &quot;Three Moves Ahead&quot; suite seem like they'd be the Ministry's bread and butter, though I'm not too sure what level of what mode would best represent them. And then there are the surreal gifts like &quot;Such Stuff as Dreams Are Made Of&quot;, &quot;Palace of the Mind&quot; or &quot;Atral Projection&quot;). </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> tl;dr : rules-wise, how would you handle altering someone's (or several people's) perception on the fly with telepathy ? Has anyone tried telepathic deception in-game ?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26426-trianoma4evah","name":"Trianoma4Evah","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-14T05:23:46-07:00","id":1476374,"title":"","content":"Before you go any further: do you have <b>Prometheus Unbound</b>? It greatly expands the versatility of the Aptitudes\u201d.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-14T06:20:13-07:00","id":1476377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1476373-\u200b-\u00e6on-rule-questions-about-recreating-psychic-gifts-with-regular-telepathy?p=1476374#post1476374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Before you go any further: do you have <b>Prometheus Unbound</b>? It greatly expands the versatility of the Aptitudes\u201d.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do, but even taking in the gross and sublime purviews of Telepathy allowing for it, I'm not sure how you can convert many of them.<br /> <br /> I get that you could in theory make yourself the avatar of the concept of banality to replicate &quot;Refuge in Banality&quot; or an avatar of Trustworthiness for &quot;Doppelg\u00e4nger&quot;, but is &quot;Embodying an abstraction&quot; Psychbending 3 adjacent ? And how do you go from embodying a concept to creating a fitting illusion to help, let alone complex illusions like &quot;Such stuff dreams are made of&quot;. <br /> <br /> Also, can Telepathy have physical side effects ? If through Telepathy I made myself an avatar of &quot;unnoticed&quot; to recreate &quot;Veil of the Unseen&quot;, how would it erase physical traces of my presence ?<br /> <br /> So I was wondering if anyone had considered converting these psychic gifts, and if they did, did they come up with a system to handle illusions, or live mental alterations like &quot;Recursion&quot; or the &quot;Three Moves Ahead&quot; suite ? Or did they stick to converting gifts one-by-one ?<br /> <br /> My problem is not so much what you could in theory do as a subquantum user ( though already that can be puzzling as shown above with &quot;Veil of the Unseen&quot; or a power like &quot;Power transfer&quot; that looks a lot like proto-Quantakinesis in an inappropriate era ) but how would you implement it within the Aptitude/Mode framework.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26426-trianoma4evah","name":"Trianoma4Evah","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}